
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>半导体设备 AI 诊断平台</title>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

    <style>
        /* 统一页面颜色和尺寸 */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f3f6fb;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        /* 顶部导航栏 */
        .header {
            background: #142238;
            color: white;
            padding: 22px 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #b8c7dc;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .demo-tag {
            background: #334155;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* 页面主体 */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 28px auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
        }

        /* 通用卡片布局 */
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #e7edf5;
        }

        .card-label {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card-value {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .card-note {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .risk {
            color: #dc2626;
        }

        .score {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        /* 风险警告区域 */
        .alert {
            background: #fff1f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
            border-left: 5px solid #dc2626;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .alert-title {
            color: #b91c1c;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .alert p {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #7f1d1d;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* 异常事件表格 */
        .table-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e7edf5;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
        }

        .table-heading {
            padding: 22px 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e7edf5;
        }

        .table-heading h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .table-heading p {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f7;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        th {
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        td {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .batch {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #fee2e2;
            color: #b91c1c;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 28px 10px;
        }

        /* 让页面在窄屏幕上也能使用 */
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .header {
                padding: 20px;
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 0 14px;
                margin-top: 20px;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }

        /* 异常统计卡片 */

    .stats-grid {

        display:grid;

        grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);

        gap:16px;

        margin:20px 0;

    }


    .stat-card {

        background:white;

        padding:20px;

        border-radius:12px;

        border:1px solid #e5e7eb;

    }


    .stat-card p {

        color:#64748b;

    }


    .stat-card h2 {

        font-size:30px;

        margin:10px 0;

    }
        
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- 顶部标题 -->
    <header class="header">
        <div>
            <h1>半导体设备 AI 诊断平台</h1>
            <p>Equipment Intelligence & Anomaly Monitoring</p>
        </div>

        <span class="demo-tag">模拟数据 · 演示环境</span>
    </header>

    <main class="container">

        <!-- 设备概览 -->
        <h2 class="section-title">设备运行概览</h2>

        <form method="get" action="/dashboard">

    <label>
        选择设备：
    </label>


    <select name="equipment_id">

        {% for item in equipment_list %}

        <option value="{{ item }}"
        {% if item == data.equipment %}
        selected
        {% endif %}
        >

        {{ item }}

        </option>

        {% endfor %}

    </select>


    <button type="submit">
        查询
    </button>

</form>

        <section class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-label">设备编号</div>
                <div class="card-value">{{ data.equipment }}</div>
                <div class="card-note">当前分析设备</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-label">设备健康评分</div>
                <div class="card-value score">
                    {{ data.health_score }}<span style="font-size:16px;"> / 100</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-note">基于当前演示规则计算</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-label">风险等级</div>
                <div class="card-value risk">{{ data.risk_level }}</div>
                <div class="card-note">建议进一步核查异常记录</div>
            </div>

        </section>

        
<!-- 风险提示 -->
<section class="alert">
    {% if data.risk_level == "高风险" %}
        <div class="alert-title">⚠ 设备高风险提示</div>
        <p>
            当前设备健康评分较低，存在较高风险。
            请结合异常批次、设备实际传感器数据、
            工艺规范及现场检查结果进一步确认。
            本页面使用模拟数据，不代表真实设备状态。
        </p>
    {% elif data.risk_level == "关注" %}
        <div class="alert-title">⚠ 设备风险关注</div>
        <p>
            当前设备存在需要关注的风险。
            建议持续监测健康评分，并结合现场情况进一步核查。
            本页面使用模拟数据，不代表真实设备状态。
        </p>
    {% else %}
        <div class="alert-title">✓ 设备状态提示</div>
        <p>
            当前健康评分对应的风险等级为正常，
            暂无需要通过本提示强调的高风险状态。
            本页面使用模拟数据，不代表真实设备状态。
        </p>
    {% endif %}
</section>



        <!-- 健康趋势图 -->

        <section class="table-card">

        <div class="table-heading">

        <h2>
        设备健康趋势
        </h2>

        <p>
        最近五次检测评分变化
        </p>

        </div>


        <div style="padding:20px">

        <canvas id="healthChart"></canvas>

        </div>


        </section>

        <!-- 异常事件 -->
        <section class="table-card">

            <div class="table-heading">
                <h2>异常事件记录</h2>
                <p>展示当前诊断报告解析出的异常批次</p>
                        <!-- 新增：异常统计卡片 -->

        <section class="stats-grid">

            <div class="stat-card">
                <p>异常总数</p>
                <h2>{{ stats.total }}</h2>
                <span>当前诊断报告</span>
              </div>


            <div class="stat-card">
                <p>温度异常</p>
                <h2>{{ stats.temperature }}</h2>
                <span>条异常记录</span>
            </div>


            <div class="stat-card">
                <p>压力异常</p>
                <h2>{{ stats.pressure }}</h2>
                <span>条异常记录</span>
            </div>


            <div class="stat-card">
                <p>低良率异常</p>
                <h2>{{ stats.yield }}</h2>
                <span>条异常记录</span>
            </div>

        </section>
            </div>

            <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>批次编号</th>
                            <th>异常类型</th>
                            <th>检测数值</th>
                            <th>状态</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>

                    <tbody>
                        {% for event in data.abnormal_events %}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="batch">{{ event.batch }}</td>
                            <td>{{ event.type }}</td>
                            <td>{{ event.value }}</td>
                            <td><span class="status">待核查</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        {% else %}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="4">当前报告没有解析到异常事件</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

        </section>

        <footer class="footer">
            Semiconductor Equipment AI Diagnosis · Demo Version
        </footer>

    </main>


    <script>

        fetch(
            "/health_history/{{data.equipment}}"
        )

        .then(
            response => response.json()
        )

        .then(
            result => {

                const ctx =
                document.getElementById(
                    "healthChart"
                );

                new Chart(ctx, {

                    type:"line",

                    data:{

                        labels:
                        result.days,

                        datasets:[{

                            label:"健康评分",

                            data:
                            result.scores,

                            tension:0.3

                        }]

                    },

                    options:{

                        responsive:true,

                        scales:{

                            y:{

                                min:0,

                                max:100

                            }

                        }

                    }


                });

            }

        );

    </script>

  
<div>

<h3>
AI趋势分析
</h3>

<p>
历史健康趋势：
{{ trend.trend }}
</p>

<p>
当前设备风险：
{{ data.risk_level }}
</p>

<p>
趋势判断等级：
{{ trend.level }}
</p>

<p>
分析说明：
{{ trend.message }}
</p>

</div>




</body>
</html>


